Author: chenxinyuanchen@xiaomi.com (Xiaomi).

Match with stock amethyst swinfo.ko (OS3.0.306.0, vendor_boot): same module
name, author, licence, "fingerprint" string parameter, depends=minidump, the
same functions (swinfo_init, platform_ikconfig_read, add_data_to_dump_region)
and strings (/proc/swinfo, platform_config.gz, IKCFG_ST/IKCFG_ED, FINGERPRINT).
BoardConfig.mk already passes swinfo.fingerprint=$(LINEAGE_VERSION).

Changes: the .incbin path, hard-coded as drivers/xiaomi/swinfo/... for an
in-tree build, comes from SWINFO_CONFIG_GZ (set in Kbuild to
$(obj)/config_platform_data.gz). The release Makefile's rules that gzip the
kernel .config are kept in Kbuild.
